[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) was marked known: one issue, one fix queued. Read report by report,
it holds three problems. Engineering closed #4471 on 5 October with answers for two of them. The
third is still open.

<Callout kind="warn">
#4471 is closed, but the one-day move is not fixed. Its reports were filed under <code>parser</code>, so the
parser fix marks them done. That fix changes the date order, not the day.
</Callout>

## What #4471 holds

<ProblemTable
  ticket={4471}
  tickets={{
